Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Seventh Episode\NThe Magic Tree\NSave the Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, everyone, here is part two of "The Return of the Great Witch."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire, turned into a doll by the magic of Hecate's mother, Madame Hell,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}falls under Madame Hell's spell and heads toward Demon Cave.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, Hecate, wanting no part in becoming a grand witch,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}disguises herself as a kitten and runs away from home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She then finds the doll-ified Sapphire and helps her escape to Goldland,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}home of Sapphire's dear friend, Prince Franz.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prince Franz realizes that the flaxen-haired maiden he loves{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is actually Sapphire, and resolves to protect her from the demon's hands even at the cost of his life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, Madame Hell's dark forces attack Goldland Castle,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}turning everyone inside into stone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Franz fights Mephisto with all his remaining strength.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Exhausted, he is helpless as Sapphire is carried off by the demon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Franz...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't be so sad, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Little kitten... can you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even cover your eyes... Mysterious kitten, do you understand my grief?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a magical cat, you don't have the power to save my Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You demons, give Sapphire back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, don't give up. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves, demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, I know where Sapphire is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where Sapphire is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama and Papa must have taken Sapphire back to the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take Franz there, what will Mama and Papa say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I get scolded, but if something awful happens to Franz...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't bear it if something terrible happened to wonderful Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Little kitten, aren't you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Did you figure it out? Which way is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, Franz, come save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How frustrating! Where on earth is that idiot Hecate loitering?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not search with the demon orb, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,taking off to play without even asking Hecate's parents—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,what on earth were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you haven't disciplined her properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't nag me, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even Hecate is too scared of those gods to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't your demon's crystal ball cloudy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Demon Orb is the demon's soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tarnished and you haven't even polished it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year around Christmas, demons bring nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining and keep polishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Franz knows about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, as soon as Hecate gets back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll be forced to have the heart-swap surgery immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to escape before Hecate gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth is Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're going in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitten, do you really know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What, that house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Sapphire trapped in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, the demon caught her so she can't answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:06:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here... anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that kitten tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true! Franz, how could you say I tricked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I just felt so sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why... That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, kitten! So you were a minion of the demon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not! No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You devils! You're hiding in the shadows, laughing at me, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Barasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, you cowardly fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw my chance and escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! My Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm deceiving this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm happy as long as I can stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sapphire? You look so sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I... I'm not Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Hecate, the demon's daughter. I was the kitten, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon's daughter? Why on earth would a demon's daughter...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so heartbroken that I took Sapphire's form to comfort you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Lord Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,, How could I ever forgive this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You were making a fool of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You were laughing at me, demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a demon could do something so cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why... why was I born as the child of a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, she finally finished polishing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She got away while I was distracted polishing the orb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you useless demon...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, don't give me any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like the good-for-nothings at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Let go! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggling is useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.59,0:10:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It got dirty again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it, you were trying to help us, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you disguise yourself as Sapphire for my sake, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, there is only one way to save Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents are the ones who kidnapped Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So she must be locked up at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where? Where is your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are, you're no match for Mama and Papa. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mama and Papa went blind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Blind your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it can be cured right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They say if you drink sap from the Demon Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,at the peak of Mount Harz, you go blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The cursed Mount Harz...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa and Mama are using the Demon Orb to look for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so I made a fake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fake me, go for a walk and sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no sukina oji sama ♪\NMy beloved prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.91,0:12:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama! I found Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate's been found!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is finally it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's at the foot of Mount Harz, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't just stand there, hurry up and fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright, I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it? Grab Hecate by the scruff of her neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what terrible language for someone like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:13:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no sukina oji sama ♪\NMy beloved prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ La la la la la ♪\N.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what were you doing? Mama is furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloning spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what on earth are you doing?! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the Demon Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama said anyone who touches it gets cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,by the Great Demon King of Hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But... but this is the only way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, wait here. I'll go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ono yo!\N- Axe arise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, it's dangerous! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Demon King is angry. But no matter what happens to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can save Sapphire! Let's get out of here quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.37,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The demon's tree is cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You went near that tree knowing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind me! If Papa or Mama find you, we won't be able to save Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, stay away from me and follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Prince Franz, wait until I give the signal just like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, where on earth did Hecate go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, that girl does nothing but worry her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama! Hecate is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hecate's... finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hecate, where on earth have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, don't get so worked up. It seems Hecate is very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sick? No matter how bad it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we're doing the surgery to transfer Sapphire's male heart right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, in her condition, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, that's why I say you're too soft! Quick, prepare for surgery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aparasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, bring Sapphire here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Burasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.89,0:17:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sapphire's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go out until Hecate calls for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come for me to become a grand witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, once you're reborn as a grand witch, any illness will be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:18:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am reborn! Mama, Papa, let's propose a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mata Vamesha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Papa, a toast please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damari Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama, classy people always make a toast when celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Classy people? A toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Right, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To celebrate the birth of the great witch Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Papa, Mama...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes... I can't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz? Is Franz here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you? What are you doing? Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Hecate's signal! Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Franz coming to rescue Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, quick, escape with Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed your own mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just Mama. I've betrayed the Great Demon King of Hell, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why I'm done for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Run away with me! I don't want you to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate is dying? Hecate?! That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one, which one? I wanna know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot! Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, pass through the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.77,0:20:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear God, please help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.38,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate may be a witch's child, but please save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she's a demon's child, she has a heart purer than any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,God saved your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,God? So we're inside the chapel...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.89,0:21:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a child of a demon. If I enter a chapel, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you got better in here. Far from dying...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...you came back to life right inside the chapel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you may be a devil's child,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.45,0:21:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but God protected you because your heart is pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, He saved you from the Great Demon King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange for a devil's child to enter a chapel and be saved by God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you're an angel to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Papa and Mama's voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our eyes are healed now, so you don't need to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa apologized to the Great Demon King of Hell, so everything's okay now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.89,0:22:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama won't nag you anymore, so please, I'm begging you, come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama and Papa are worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.97,0:22:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going back Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.19,0:22:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Zubarasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.49,0:23:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Franz!
